(The structure key references "PC" [Pre-Chorus] several times, but no Pre-Chorus section is notated anywhere on the source chart — only Intro, Verse 1, Verse 2, Chorus, Bridge, and Instrumental are given. It's possible "PC" is a labeling mismatch from a fuller reference chart; nothing was fabricated here. Verse 2's "D#m" chord placement was ambiguous in the extracted text — it printed merged onto the lyric line rather than as a separate chord marker. Best-effort placement shown before "alicerçada"; worth a quick visual check against the original PDF.)
